        "@value": "in paragraph (c), by substituting for the words “subparagraph 15(1)(b)(iv), (v) or (vi)” the words “subparagraph 15(1)(b)(vi) or paragraph 15(1)(d)”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/30/eng@/~cl_12__para_b",
