        "@value": "Subsection 49(3) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years, or to a fine not exceeding two thousand ringgit or to both” the words “a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit”. Amendment of section 54"
      }
    },
